The **single biggest factor** in getting that slow, smooth drone glide is keeping `motion_bucket_id` between **30–50**. Anything above 80 will introduce camera shake and chaotic motion that ruins the cinematic feel. Pair that with a well-composed input image and the post-processing interpolation step, and you'll land very close to what you see above.
